## Run

```bash
cp .env.example .env
set -a; . ./.env; set +a
make run
```

Endpoints:

- API: `http://localhost:8080/api/v1`
- Live health: `http://localhost:8080/health/live`
- Ready health: `http://localhost:8080/health/ready`
- OpenAPI: `http://localhost:8080/openapi.json`
- Swagger UI: `http://localhost:8080/docs`

